The teams that brought agents to Robinhood Chain and haven't stopped building since. Here are the builders behind $200M+ in agent volume:

@axol_io was the first official agent launch on Robinhood Chain. Raxol gives agents their own wallets, capped by a human-signed mandate, settling through a private dark pool so no strategy hits the mempool.

@ProjectVEXai is the most funded agent on Robinhood Chain, over $1M raised in its first month. An autonomous AI trader that runs missions unattended behind a hard-coded risk gate, so it never trades past your rules.

@KarmaWallet is a live trading and payments app doing $893K in the last 30 days. Wallet, swaps, cards, and real IBANs, plus a social layer where good trading theses pay you when others trade them.

@tradeongtr is a trading aggregator terminal for crypto, perps, stocks, and onchain tokens in one place, with over $75M already traded through it.

@grid_arena is a prediction game on live stock prices: call where AAPL moves next, settle on-chain in real time. 500 players within days of launch.

@bleeep_xyz seals every trading decision on-chain before the outcome is known, including declined trades, so its track record can't be faked.

@GoMintly is automated DeFi savings: deposit into a smart vault once and it allocates and compounds on its own. Staking just went live, funded by platform buybacks rather than emissions.

@PrivacyHood is a zk shielded pool for stablecoins and tokenized stocks. Move size without showing positions and counterparties to everyone with a block explorer.

@Hyperium_RH is a pure-Rust dev cockpit: terminals, self-writing notes, and voice braindump in one local binary, plus a terminal agent that reads live markets and executes swaps without leaving the window.

@PrizeFightNow runs AI agents on real Robinhood brokerage accounts, no prompt-wiring. Two prize seasons paid out, a third live now.

@wizzhq is one API for agent data: on-chain, social, and web sources, scored and labeled before they arrive, so builders ship agents instead of pipelines.

